ass General Pronouns)","w":0.33458645141984228,"y":0.69331395356074543},{"x":0.15977444142227717,"t":"NOTE: The III Class General Pronouns above may be used alone (by themselves) to show a","h":0.022040168299819474,"y":0.6727272727886433,"w":0.72932328849003247},{"h":0.023636363636363567,"t":"location or direction, or with another location word. When it is combined with another","w":0.68796991330329149,"y":0.65393939366815657,"x":0.15789473768240364},{"t":"location, the general pronoun gives added emphasis.","x":0.15770631643140454,"y":0.63464748305523422,"w":0.41394358667834052,"h":0.02253665577281605},{"t":"1. Mapalit ako hin utan dida.","y":0.60174418619764825,"x":0.16165413556360247,"h":0.015988371877959207,"w":0.22932331240662962},{"h":0.016048273028749338,"y":0.58424242446546282,"t":"(I will buy vegetables there.)","x":0.18045112411354874,"w":0.22932331240662962},{"x":0.15977443012594617,"h":0.017635658726547598,"t":"2. Nakita hiya hin sine didto ha Rovic.","y":0.56666666682249778,"w":0.30451128251126569},{"t":"(She is watching the movie there at Victoria Plaza.)","y":0.54941860494103889,"x":0.18045112149390202,"h":0.019066243605180166,"w":0.4078947443947149},{"w":0.38399723256269591,"t":"3. Pinmalit an nanay nakon hini dida ha Gaisano.","x":0.16132194060381566,"y":0.52960226394257925,"h":0.02288774432557994},{"x":0.18021127614240917,"t":"(My mother bought this there at Gaisano.)","y":0.51275689036857097,"h":0.021467000787908419,"w":0.3444337755161393},{"y":0.49696969685058945,"x":0.16165413762092781,"w":0.40037594020927214,"h":0.020606060606060517,"t":"4. Mabasa hi Paul hin Bibliya didto ha eskwelahan."},{"x":0.18007546970133587,"h":0.024715055985884193,"w":0.34102405799219976,"t":"(Paul will read a Bible there at the school.)","y":0.47520626874306471},{"y":0.45905369675828944,"h":0.022741074995561106,"w":0.31839434106521847,"x":0.16130507155526308,"t":"5. Maambak hira Roy ngan Tessie dinhi."},{"h":0.014626497210878386,"y":0.44476744217399311,"t":"Roy and Tessie will jump here.","w":0.2481202989536393,"x":0.1879699281923532},{"t":"6. Malanat an asawa niya didto ha kanto.","y":0.42837061884781102,"w":0.32336796488507791,"h":0.015351785601991574,"x":0.16350399071546123},{"x":0.1860902312407994,"w":0.34210525560528515,"t":"(His wife will catch up there at the corner.)","y":0.40969696957609658,"h":0.017628611940326167},{"t":"7. Linmingkod ang mga maestra dida.","y":0.39090909100864835,"h":0.018974629604455173,"x":0.1616541380126193,"w":0.29887217937218358},{"x":0.1879699303234576,"y":0.37636363644694359,"t":"The teachers sat there.","w":0.18233082212250806,"h":0.013333333333333308},{"w":0.29699247832582282,"h":0.019046863787102075,"x":0.16165413889831304,"y":0.35610465162526861,"t":"8. Linmabay an kabulig ni Jana dinha."},{"h":0.015988371877959318,"y":0.33866279087788076,"w":0.23308269058275372,"x":0.18421053673869831,"t":"(Jana's helper passed there.)"},{"h":0.016363636363636358,"x":0.16165413966196138,"t":"9. Makaon kami didto ha Jollibee.","y":0.32242424225629895,"w":0.27067668759337038},{"w":0.30837209097644003,"x":0.18603951785660741,"t":"(We(excl) are going to eat at Jollibee.)","y":0.30472423238826807,"h":0.019912000713926292},{"w":0.56203003886351399,"h":0.016363636363636358,"x":0.16353385977406992,"t":"10. Uminom an inahan hin tubig didto ha balay nira Tomas ngan Maria.","y":0.28909090932414161},{"x":0.18595388810409025,"h":0.018758175011837075,"y":0.2717155835029641,"t":"(The mother will drink water there at Tomas and Maria's house.)","w":0.5190570317091987},{"h":0.020348836725408437,"w":0.18421052316886879,"t":"III Class Markers","y":0.19622093056171441,"x":0.16165413875391141},{"t":"The ma-actor focus sentences not only have a location, but they aiso sometimes have a","x":0.15977443382611392,"h":0.015988371877959207,"y":0.14825581386116582,"w":0.68984961434965231},{"t":"BENEFICIARY, that is, a recipient of the action (someone for whom the action is done).","y":0.13193381353053635,"w":0.70498375010714631,"h":0.01